+`doctor.main([])` scans the cwd: `normalize_argv([])` returns `["scan", "."]`. The `--verbose` check, however, reads the host's `sys.argv[1:]`, because `[]` is falsy in `argv or sys.argv[1:]` (`:2186`). [SOURCE-CONFIRMED]
