+- `src/somnus_debug/pycache_cleaner/core.py:274-321`
+- Executed probe: `/tmp/w1/ex_perf.py` (setup commands: copy of repo `src/`, `skills/`, `tests/`, root `*.py`, and `src/` copied four times into `/tmp/w1/perf`)
