+- `async def go(*a, **k) -> int:` (lines 18-19)
+build_index failures over repo .py files: [16 of 16 files: 'invalid syntax' at line 9/10]
+'x = [  # type: List[int]\n 1]\n' build_index: SyntaxError | plain ast.parse: ok
