+| onboard.py / delta.py | — | — | L (all documented exit codes) |
+
+## 5. Coverage matrix: per doctor detector
+
+| Category | T | S | L (fixture) | Notes |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| syntax_errors | — | S | L | |
+| tokenization_errors | — | — | L | Emitted alongside syntax error |
